{"ID":"20240522082250-6qrxc7f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082250-6qrxc7f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082250-6qrxc7f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092712-nsow754\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092714-e16e62a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522092712-nsow754\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"張孟超醫師的手顫抖案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522093132"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522092712-nsow754","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-nsow754","updated":"20240522093132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一、【手顫案例】"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-pt79hf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-pt79hf3","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎12-23-2008初診"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-ekk4frq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-ekk4frq","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"C.R.年輕人，21歲，5尺3寸，140英磅，身材瘦小，墨西哥人，不擅英語，無人翻譯時，溝通時有困難，好在他的上司lisa乃倪師的超級粉絲，不但幫他翻譯寫好每一次的問診單，還幫他煮水藥，甚至幫員工支付診費，真善心人士也。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-d0conwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-d0conwh","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者雙手不停抖動，已有三年病史，未嘗治癒，常常影響正常作息及工作，頗為苦惱，胸口時有揪心之感，身冷，四肢冰冷，早晨睡醒仍累，精神不能集中，不易出汗，但有手汗，睡眠可，大便每日一到二次，未盡感，口不渴，喜溫水及熱茶，白天頻尿，色淡，喝完水馬上就要小便，但量小。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-xvdo6na","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-xvdo6na","updated":"20240522092958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷：少陰虛寒證（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"證）"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-z7ztl0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-z7ztl0r","updated":"20240522093009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"註："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曰，若痰象明顯，則為藜蘆甘草湯證。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-136zlth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-136zlth","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者經濟狀況非佳，考慮其年輕，而手顫之症真武湯往往取效不捷，欲其速愈，故捨真武湯不用。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-cvx4je6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-cvx4je6","updated":"20240522092950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仿『扁鵲心書』"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金液丹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（制硫黃）合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乾姜附子湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，尊倪師法。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-zc52b6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-zc52b6n","updated":"20240522093017"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"開立處方：【生硫黃15克 漢唐生附6克 干姜10克一日量】七天份，早晚飯前空腹溫服。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"註：嘗見"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師診治（被西醫放棄）重症腎衰竭病患，全身水腫，已無尿意，一劑生硫黃七錢、生附四錢，配以補腎利水之品。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一日夜，退去3500cc尿液，一周後，恢復正常。自此才知，張鍚純使用生硫黃的劑量（每日生吞綠豆大小），與倪師實有天壤之別。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-o5l2jcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-o5l2jcl","updated":"20240522093021"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再註："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金液丹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（制硫黃）合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乾姜附子湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"此法對帕金森氏症有一定療效。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-a6vm995","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-a6vm995","updated":"20240522093038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三註：陰寒實之癌痛，或腹水重症，以"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生附、生硫黃、配小量生甘遂"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，在處方中往往有出奇的效果。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-xabnyfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-xabnyfk","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二診，患者自述，手抖剩下百分之30，手汗仍有。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-xjdd7fj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-xjdd7fj","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼診：瞳孔反應弱，腎陽虛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-1gz7snn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-1gz7snn","updated":"20240522092915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"開立處方：【上方"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生硫黃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"改為20克，合"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝加龍牡湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、麥冬及補腎之品】兩周份，早晚飯前空腹溫服。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-cs1jk9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-cs1jk9y","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三診12-23-08：患者自述，手抖已愈。諸症皆善。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-l4sbqh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-l4sbqh0","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學生孟超報告到此1-14-09"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-v136rey","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-v136rey","updated":"20240522092712"}},{"ID":"20240522092712-40tht2y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-40tht2y","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"※附相關條文，以利檢索。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-8va3efw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-8va3efw","updated":"20240522092907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『扁鵲心書』：手顫病-----四肢為諸陽之本。陽氣盛則四肢實。實則四體輕便。若手足顫搖。不能持物者。乃真元虛損也。常服"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金液丹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五兩。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"姜附湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自愈。若灸關元三百壯。則病根永去矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-niqrohz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-niqrohz","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『傷寒、金匱』："}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-dqny2q5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-dqny2q5","updated":"20240522092859"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、下之後，復發汗，晝日燒躁不得眠，夜而安靜，不嘔，不渴，無表證，脈沉微，身無大熱者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乾姜附子湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-k2six7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-k2six7k","updated":"20240522092901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、發汗，汗出不解。其人仍發熱，心下悸，頭眩，身潤動，振振欲擗地者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真武湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-e87nhvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-e87nhvw","updated":"20240522092855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、皮水為病，四肢腫，水看在皮膚中，四肢聶聶動者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防己茯苓湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-iefsz4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-iefsz4j","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、若身重汗出已，輒輕者，久久必身潤，、、、、此為黃汗，"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-9gd99ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-9gd99ue","updated":"20240522092728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"   "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝加黃耆湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-fsr6n62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-fsr6n62","updated":"20240522092725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、「趺蹶」病人常以手指臂腫動，此人身體潤潤者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"藜蘆甘草湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-ksfkd70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-ksfkd70","updated":"20240522092712"}},{"ID":"20240522092712-9d6ha0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-9d6ha0i","updated":"20240522092720"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 老師評語 :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-3jt7wnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-3jt7wnu","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    經方家與溫病派中醫之最大不同處就是經方家非常善用純陽的藥物，而這些純陽性可以救人於危難中的藥物，卻被溫病派中醫認定是大熱大毒之藥物，這種錯誤的解讀陽藥與熱藥之不同，就是導致今天中醫學之不振的主因，上面這位病人，如果遇到一般中醫師，絕對不可能會好轉，就算可以負擔得起藥費，也願意喝難以入口的中藥湯劑，由於藥物的選擇不正確，喝個十年二十年也不會見一絲功效的，希望這種案例可以讓溫病派中醫師覺醒過來，不要再繼續堅持使用溫病方，自誤又誤病人了，溫病派中醫的思維必須重新建立起正確的方向，否則溫病派中醫將是中醫發展的絆腳石。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-qai3vg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-qai3vg7","updated":"20240522092712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"     孟超是一位膽大心細的中醫師，又能體諒到病人的財力問題，是一位非常難得的良醫，我也非常以他為榮，這位病人真是很有福氣啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522092712-f1bh392","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092712-f1bh392","updated":"20240522092717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於台北2009年01月30日"}]},{"ID":"20240522092713-zwwfx2x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522092713-zwwfx2x"}},{"ID":"20240522092714-e16e62a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522092714-e16e62a"}}]}